--- TS1_generation (SMD_inter_beta) ---

Generates rep1's starting TS1-region configuration ('TS1_rep1.lmp') via an initial SMD run
along 'dD' (same protocol as ../../PMF_react_TS1_beta/react_generation/), before the pairwise
legs above pull from it. Includes its own 'lmp_files/' (100 numbered window seed structures)
and Vives job script. Single run, not a rep1/2/3 set.

Note: this README documents pre-existing content; no existing file was modified.
